---
output: preproc, svg
---
@startuml
' In a Python block, an escaped text line belongs to the block like any text
' line: it is emitted at each turn of the loop.
' EXPECT (preproc):
' participant A
' note over A
' !item 0
' !item 1
' end note
participant A
note over A
!for i in range(2):
    !!item !{i}
end note
@enduml
